rent-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 杜尚别","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%9C%E5%B0%9A%E5%88%AB"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87871176"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q9365"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159146325","name":"霍罗格","country":"TJK","lat":37.48752,"lon":71.54756,"kind":"city","region":"TJ-GB","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"霍罗格 · 地点概要","geo":"霍罗格 属于半干旱气候（柯本气候分类法:BSk）；冬季寒冷多雪，夏季炎热干燥。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q467501","articleTitle":"霍羅格","sourceRevision":94737607,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 霍罗格","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9C%8D%E7%BE%85%E6%A0%BC"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94737607"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q467501"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159146327","name":"苦盏","country":"TJK","lat":40.28998,"lon":69.61993,"kind":"city","region":"TJ-SU","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"苦盏 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"由于苦盏位于费尔干纳盆地而杜尚别坐落于吐火罗盆地，突厥斯坦山脉、横亘其间，陆路交通往往需经乌兹别克斯坦境内绕行。\n费尔干纳盆地北缘的与南侧的突厥斯坦山脉于城西相接，铸就了苦盏作为费尔干纳门户的重要地理优势。\n约公元前160年左右，塞种人部落入侵巴克特里亚，占据了费尔干纳盆地，建立了中国史书中称为大宛的国家。","culture":"古典时代的城市遗址大都没有发现，但出土了一些希腊化时代的钱币和陶器。\n相传苦盏最早的人类定居点可能为阿契美尼德王朝的居鲁士大帝所建，居鲁士大帝在死前最后一次讨伐马萨格泰人的征途上，在苦盏西南建立了。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q373808","articleTitle":"苦盏","sourceRevision":94050844,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 苦盏","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8B%A6%E7%9B%8F"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94050844"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q373808"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159134343","name":"古比雪夫斯基","country":"TJK","lat":37.9794,"lon":68.68897,"kind":"city","region":"TJ-KT","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159134349","name":"库洛布","country":"TJK","lat":37.92116,"lon":69.77573,"kind":"city","region":"TJ-KT","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159134353","name":"伊斯塔拉夫尚","country":"TJK","lat":39.92192,"lon":69.00146,"kind":"city","region":"TJ-SU","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"伊斯塔拉夫尚 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"由索格特州负责管辖，位于该国西北部，距离首府苦盏78公里，面积1,830平方公里，海拔高度992米。","culture":"根据文献及考古资料，该地在公元前6至4世纪时便成为了聚居点。\n公元前6世纪，阿契美尼德王朝在现在的伊斯塔拉夫尚附近建立了居鲁士卡达城（Kurushkada，希腊史料记为Cyreschata），以居鲁士大帝得名，希腊史料中也称之为居鲁波利斯（Cyropolis）。","see":"中国古称“大宛城”（或“贺山城”），属西域36国之一，是塔吉克斯坦其中一个保存最完好的古城。\n游览景点包括纪念建城2,500周年的“蓝色穹顶”、城里较大的Hazrat-i-shah清真寺，以及能够看到制作手工刀具的伊斯塔拉夫尚市场。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q936510","articleTitle":"伊斯塔拉夫尚","sourceRevision":94806354,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 伊斯塔拉夫尚","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E6%96%AF%E5%A1%94%E6%8B%89%E5%A4%AB%E5%B0%9A"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94806354"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q936510"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159127083","name":"库尔干秋别","country":"TJK","lat":37.83731,"lon":68.77135,"kind":"city","region":"TJ-KT","rank":8,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"库尔干秋别 · 地点概要","geo":"该市地处瓦赫什河河谷，位于塔吉克斯坦西南部。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q648567","articleTitle":"博赫塔爾","sourceRevision":94313453,"method":"Full-article section exc